port x11/zenity
type port
target @any
reason "zenity 3.44 (GTK3) -> 4.2.2 (GTK4, GNOME 50 era). Migrate compat -> dops; USE_GNOME gtk30 -> gtk40 + libadwaita; drop the removed libnotify meson option and (unused in 4.x) libnotify dep; -Dmanpage=false to avoid help2man; keep python BINARY_ALIAS."

file materialize dragonfly/Makefile -> Makefile
file materialize dragonfly/distinfo -> distinfo
file materialize dragonfly/pkg-plist -> pkg-plist
